  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plan Norge- Girls Get Equal: realising rights building resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adolescent girls and young women aged 10-24 are empowered, resilient and exercise their rights. Quality inclusive education, economic empowerment, SRHR and meaningful youth engagement for adolescent girls/young women, their families and communities so that they are empowered, have increased resilience against climate change and other shocks/stresses and exercise their rights in contexts challenged by gender norms, harmful practices and poverty in Niger. Other local IP is Kawtal.</narrative>
  </description>
